    "body": "The FT app has an app manifest, but the JSON manifest has only a static hardcoded \"FT pink\" color set (plus a background color property which is used only for splash screen).\n\nTheme color from JSON manifest doesn't end up being used (at least when I tested it in Chrome), because we always set `<meta>` for everything anyway (which is great, because we prefer `<meta>` over JSON manifest).\n",
